<title>USA: USDA adds vegetable oil to Tunisia GSM-102.</title>
<headline>USDA adds vegetable oil to Tunisia GSM-102.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Tuesday said it added vegetable oil to the commodities available to Tunisia under GSM-102.</p>
<p>USDA said the total fiscal year allocation for sales to Tunisia remains at $30 million, of which $20 million has been released.</p>
</text>
